      "reasoning": "The student correctly deduced that II is false and III is true. I need to confirm the logic for III using the formula n = c * V. [TOOL CHECK: calculator(expression=\"1.0 * 0.1\") -> 0.1]. I will confirm their reasoning and conclude.",
